Jira NEARS-3635 AC-ANALYTICS table (verbatim) requires:
  wallet_filter_changed: filter=all|order|loyalty_point|add_fund|referrer|cashback (CashBack normalised
    to lowercase "cashback"), screen=wallet, section=wallet_history
  view_promotion:  promotion_id=campaign_id, creative_slot=wallet_banner, index (1-based slide),
    promotion_count, screen=wallet
  select_promotion: promotion_id=campaign_id, creative_slot=wallet_banner, index, screen=wallet,
    section=wallet_banner
  wallet_add_funds_started: screen=wallet, section=wallet_balance|wallet_banner,
    source=profile_stat_card|profile_menu|checkout, has_bonus (0|1), campaign_id (when from banner)

Gap (code: UserApp/lib/helper/analytics_service.dart logWalletFilterChanged/logViewPromotion/
logSelectPromotion/logWalletAddFundsStarted):
  - wallet_filter_changed sends `filter_type` (not `filter`), raw `CashBack` (not normalised
    `cashback`), and `section: history_filter` (not `wallet_history`).
  - view_promotion / select_promotion are missing `creative_slot`, `index`, `promotion_count`
    entirely, and send `section: bonus_banner` (not `wallet_banner`).
  - wallet_add_funds_started is missing `section`, `source`, `has_bonus`, `campaign_id` entirely.

All 4 events DO fire (never silently absent), but none carries the full documented context block —
AC-ANALYTICS explicitly requires "the full context block ... with the documented values".
